---
title: Step 8 — User log out
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant C as controllers/auth
    participant RT as RefreshToken model
    participant P as protect

    U->>C: POST /auth/logout (cookies)
    C->>RT: revoke this refresh token (revokedAt = now)
    C-->>U: 200 + clear token and refreshToken cookies

    U->>P: GET /auth/me (no token)
    P-->>U: 401 Not authorized
